            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PP2281, 3.5\" x 20\" Heavy Duty Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy duty framed 3.5\" x 20\" door push plates made of high quality solid brass for longevity. Packaged with matching finish brass mounting screws for easy installation. Available in different finishes choices. For commercial or residential use.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-PP2281_size.gif?v=1704354723\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana PP2281 3.5\" x 20\" Heavy Duty Push Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-3-5-x-15-push-plate-deltana-pp2280\"><b>3.5\" x 15\" Heavy Duty Push Plate</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Deltana PP2281 Door Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Frame Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flat Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PP2281.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PP2281 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
